ravenrs-deck
============

The code under src/ and tests/, and build.rs, comes from DeckCraft
(https://github.com/storytold/deckcraft), commit b0c77ebd6a6fe6c9037cfbe1c8a7f397304b2205
(version 0.18.1): its crates geom, color, model, fonts, text, anim, render, pdf, pptx, format,
media, engine and mcp, brought together as modules of this one crate by
scripts/storytold/convert.py. build.rs is the build script of its fonts crate.

